2026-07-27T08:06:32.3994371Z i /tmp/RtmprWnjWj/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:06:32.3994736Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:06:32.3995153Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:06:32.3995785Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:06:32.3996356Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:06:32.3997179Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:06:32.3997810Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
